{"title":"数字赋能 全面提升项目管理水平——两江新区-长寿区快速通道项目应用案例","date":"2024-06-07","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">数字赋能 全面提升项目管理水平</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nmso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&mdash;&mdash;<span style=\"letter-spacing:.4pt\">两江新区<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>长寿区快速通道项目应用案例</span></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:1.9pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">项目概况<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">两江新区至长寿区快速通道项目（以下简称&ldquo;江长项目&rdquo;）南起两江新区三环高速，接快速路六纵线，穿越明月山至长寿城区。项目全长约<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 23.7 </span>公里，为城市快速路，双向<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 6 </span>车道，设计速度<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 80 </span>公里<span lang=\"EN-US\"> / </span>小时，含特长隧道<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 1 </span>座（长度<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 4.5 </span>公里），全互通立交节点<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 4 </span>座，项目总投资约<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 100 </span>亿元，是重庆市第一条快速融城通道，也是重庆主城都市区东北向大通道。项目建成后将进一步增强两江新区与长寿区之间的快速连接，降低两个国家级开发区之间的物流成本，有力促进两江新区、渝北区、长寿区及渝东北城市组团协同发展，为推进重庆主城都市区基础设施互联互通、打造&ldquo;<span lang=\"EN-US\">1 </span>小时通勤圈&rdquo;发挥重要作用。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-no-proof:yes\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202406/1.png\" /></span><br />\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:1.9pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">建设目标<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">充分融合城投特色管理理念和业务逻辑，意在以&ldquo;单项目研发，多项目复用&rdquo;为突破口打造自主可控、包容开放的<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM+GIS </span>项目智慧管理平台。平台以<span lang=\"EN-US\"> WBS&nbsp;</span>工程分解结构为核心、以<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM </span>模型为信息载体，关联施工过程中的各项业务数据，逐步形成数据融合。经过施工过程中的数据反馈，实现各项业务数据的态势感知，形成数字资产并完成交付，实现工程项目建设的全过程动态管理。全面提升城投企业核心竞争力，力争打造川渝一流，行业先进的工程行业数字化管理平台。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-no-proof:yes\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202406/2.png\" /></span><br />\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<br />\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:1.9pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">智慧管理平台应用成果<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;\r\nletter-spacing:1.9pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">（一）智慧决策应用</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">基于<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM+GIS </span>基础平台底座，接入二维、三维现状数据与项目规划设计数据，集成项目建造过程中质量、安全、进度、投资等业务数据，并通过数据统计、数据分析等功能，向领导、管理决策者提供可视化的数据统计结果，辅助管理决策者一图掌握项目总体情况，进行项目决策。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-no-proof:yes\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202406/3.png\" /><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">1. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">数智规划中心。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">汇聚本项目的现状、规划、设计等数据，实现对项目及沿线的土地利用现状数据、地形地质数据、设计数据、各类管控红线数据的管理，并通过三维可视化进行展示，同时具有各类图形空间数据和属性数据的查询、分析、维护和更新等功能，构建项目规划设计一张图。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">2. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">数智建造中心。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">集成数智建管系统和智慧工地平台数据并进行可视化呈现，汇聚江长建设项目施工阶段所有数据，全场景、多维度监管江长项目建设，实现对江长项目建设进度、质量、安全、变更、资金使用需求的一张图综合把控，支撑施工统筹，提高项目整体建设成效。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">3. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">数智征拆中心。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">通过将监管与技术手段相结合，实现征地拆迁和管网迁改过程动态数据采集、统计、分析、监管。业主可以直观掌握征拆迁情况与进度，借助征拆迁一张图将评估征拆迁难度及问题显性化，并借助地图与现状基础数据为征拆迁工作提供辅助决策分析，辅助用户快速发现征拆迁进展及难点症结，从而指导工作人员高效开展征拆迁工作，促使征拆迁工作更加规范化、透明化、高效化。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">4. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">数智应急中心。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">通过与各级管理人员之间建立即时通讯连接，加强应急联动能力，实现应急信息、应急资源的高效管理，实现突发事件的安全疏散，应急指挥的决策分析等智能化应用。通过统一信息报送、突发事件协调处置及定制化的监测信息和视频共享等功能，实现相关部门间的信息上传下达、多级单位间的运行监测协同、紧急事件中的人员安全疏导。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">（二）智慧建管应用</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none;mso-no-proof:yes\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202406/4.png\" /></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">1. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">质量管理便捷化。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">融合主流传统项目管理系统的核心内容，将分项工程<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM </span>模型作为载体，通过平台完成基础数据录入及流程上报审核，依靠数据融合、数据分析、智能算法形成全新的基于<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM </span>技术的项目管理平台，用以处理项目的质量控制管理。为项目提供<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM </span>与项目管理集成化的全新平台，满足项目对信息化建设在<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM </span>深度应用中诉求和渴望，实现工程施工质量的可视化便捷管理。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">2. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">安全管理透明化。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">针对施工现场的安全事件进行综合管理，整体把控施工现场安全情况。基于<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM </span>技术建立风险评估体系、安全专项方案等，实现安全风险监控、安全隐患管控、安全事故处理等，实现工程建设过程中安全业务的全方位管理，提供更高效、更透明、更可控的管理手段。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">3. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">验收管理无纸化。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">验收管理以表格引擎、<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA </span>集中式认证等技术为支撑，实现业务表单及流程的自定义快速配置和<span lang=\"EN-US\"> CA </span>认证融合，满足各级管理部门要求，真正实现多项目数字化管理全过程业务流程管理的线上化、无纸化、协同化，实现项目无纸化归档。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">4. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">进度管理可视化。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">基于<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM</span>模型，形成基于<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM </span>模型的项目二维、三维形象进度展示以及全线工程进度的跟踪、预警 ；通过建立<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM </span>模型和管理流程的联系和规则，进行施组计划模拟、建设进度跟踪、形象进度分析、<span lang=\"EN-US\">4D </span>施工进度管理、三维可视化应用 ；最终实现对施工进度、资源调配、场地布置有效科学动态优化配置，全面掌握项目建设施工进展情况。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">5. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:.4pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">实现&ldquo;数字孪生<span lang=\"EN-US\"> + </span>工程管理&rdquo;的融合应用。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">以工程分解结构为核心，以<span lang=\"EN-US\"> BIM </span>模型为信息载体，关联施工过程中的各项业务数据，实现&ldquo;数字孪生<span lang=\"EN-US\"> + </span>工程管理&rdquo;的融合应用。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:1.9pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">应用效果<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:\r\nwidow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#4BACC6;letter-spacing:1.9pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">江长项目智慧管理平台的建设，保障项目建设各阶段的数据实时汇聚、分析展示及更新预警，多方共享信息，跨部门协作，节省大量的信息反馈时间，提升现场管理工作效率<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 30%</span>。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">通过表单引擎、<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA </span>认证技术的使用，将线下流程审批转为线上流程审批，大大缩短各业务流程的审批时间，同时还节省了大量的纸张、打印耗材使用。以计量支付为例，通常每期计量支付线下审批需要接近<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 15 </span>天的时间，通过智慧管理平台，所有数据自动计算、自动汇总，并且线上流转审批，每期从发起到审核完只需要<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 5 </span>天时间，大大提高现场的审批效率。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">智慧管理平台集成现场视频监控、环境监测、水文监测、瓦斯监测等专项监测数据，系统自动搜集各类型监测数据，并自动进行分析、预警，项目施工至今零事故发生。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 12pt 0cm 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">移动端提供巡检、监理旁站等功能，且这些功能具备现场定位、人脸识别、自动填写时间等功能，通过这些功能的使用，提高现场质量、安全管理工作的协调性，同时将巡检、旁站等工作线上化、透明化，对现场管理人员的履职行为进行在线监控，确保现场质量、安全过程管理可控。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}